# Git commits

When committing in this repo:

- One commit per concern; never stage the entire dirty tree if it mixes topics.
- Message: 1–2 sentences (max 3), specific, natural engineer voice — no generic “update files”.
- Follow `.cursor/skills/atomic-commits/SKILL.md`.
- Do not commit agent scaffolding listed in `.gitignore` (`.agents/`, `.pipeline/`, `.vibearch/`, loops, journeys, etc.).
- Do not push unless asked.
